214 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Over the past 12 years\054 my career has evolved from graphic design and art direction into a product design practice focused on complex problem spaces\056 My work spans AI\054 e\055commerce\054 fitness\054 and enterprise software\054 always with one core philosophy\072 design decisions must connect directly to measurable outcomes\056 I also thrive in ambiguity and influence through clear storytelling\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 215 0 R
     /Pg 210 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
