216 0 obj
  << /ActualText (When I\031m taking a break from the blue light\054 you can usually find me tackling DIY projects\054 managing my backyard chickens\054 or playing sports\057exploring with my son\056 I\031m also always looking for a great new audiobook or podcast \050recommendations always accepted\056\051\nLet\031s build something impactful \024 I look forward to hearing about your team\047s goals\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 217 0 R
     /Pg 210 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
